      "note": "Codex reconciled PROVISIONAL machine alignment. The seed for the arising of eye consciousness is recast as mental seed which produces the eye consciousness; the causal relative stays together at phrase depth because English makes the seed the producer. The smaller ripening, situation, intent, faculty and negation exponents remain useful lexical links. dgongs owns intent; real adds contextual emphasis and is left outside this tighter atom, despite the broader attested HGM real intent rendering. The final They/talking/here/normally think framing is not assigned to mig dbang gang yin la min no; its useful faculty and not are linked separately. Unresolved distributed grammar is omitted, never converted into a null."
